// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Helix_R_Task1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ExperimentsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3697714687" "Wonders of modern Bio-chemistry"
// DetailString :
"P220066847" "Whatever Neuron was doing to these people is unforgivible, but they do have some pretty remarkable abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PPDTESTClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1534364064" "Not your every day beat cops"
// DetailString :
"P488997456" "Freeing the experiments from their holding cells triggered a response from the clockwork in the lab, but they didn't come alone. Some PPD officers showed up with some pretty advanced hardware and the word T.E.S.T. emblazoned on their body armor. Could Neuron be conducting bio-chemical enhancement tests on PPD officers to try and produce a superior officer?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CrowClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3545656792" "Crow"
// DetailString :
"P2327758169" "Your contact in the tunnels, Crow will point the escapees in the right direction and then join you in diverting the attention of the pursuers while helping you smash the lab up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1930209612" "When I was in the labs, undergoing the genetic alteration, there were many, many more people suffering a similar fate. I want to get them out of there, but I'll need your help to do so."
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P1831842881" "Thank you, {HeroName}. If we can get those people out of there and share their stories with the city, we might just be able to put a stop to all of this.<br><br>Crow has agreed to help you once you get the people down into the tunnels, but until then, it's up to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Helix_R_Task1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P217387007" "Talk to Crow"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3958075051" "string"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P29027013" "Here's the plan, {HeroName}. You go in through the front door and free the people. It's not going to be easy, but sometimes the direct approach is the best approach.<br><br>While you are doing that, a small team and I will make our way through the tunnels to the basement of the facility. We'll bust in, and meet you and your charges there.<br><br>Once we get the people out, you and I will go back through the facility, destroy everything we can, and lead the pursuers away from the people we helped escape, that should buy them the time they need to get to safety."

