// Task - P_SL3_NT_Helix_R_Task2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MutantsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1124847418" "Ghouls... Fantastic!"
// DetailString :
"P2752798752" "It was either Ghouls, or the Chosen of Isotope. For the sake of the missing scout team you think you would have been better off with the radiation worshipping cultists over these flesh eating mutants."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ToxicWasteClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3388641948" "Waste Canisters"
// DetailString :
"P2453214573" "These canisters haven't been damaged in any way, their valves were opened, leaking their contents everywhere. Since they're locked with a unique key code you suspect this was done on purpose by whoever put these down here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ClockworkClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3575851246" "Clockwork on Duty"
// DetailString :
"P362492525" "The canisters were suspect enough with their valves opened to leak hazardous waste everywhere, but being guarded by some of Antimatter's clockwork really took the cake. It would appear that he is purposely creating the ghouls down here in the tunnels, but to what end?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResistanceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2030475548" "Missing Resistance Members"
// DetailString :
"P2145154564" "According to Bob, their team had found one of the canisters of toxic waste when they got jumped by ghouls. He managed to get this far before they caught up with him, and then you arrived in the nick of time. The fate of his comrades, however, is uncertain, but almost certainly not good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SurvivorClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1715187967" "According to the other resistance members you rescued the ghouls seemed to hesitate to move in for the kill. Could they have been trying to capture them, or, less likely, communicate with them?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ProphetClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3732868428" "Pictograph of the Prophet"
// DetailString :
"P3556494713" "The Children of Isotope aren't the greatest artists, but even still, this rudimentary drawing clearly shows the radiant goddess, Isotope, standing over her children, and to her side is someone who you can only guess is the Prophet, but to you, he looks like... Antimatter!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P241649002" "My time with the Children of Isotope was... Strange, and I don't remember everything. One thing I do recall, however, was meeting someone they called 'The Prophet'. The Children seemed to revere him nearly as much as they did me, and it seems as if he was the one truly pulling their puppet strings. If we could ally ourselves with him, we might be able to turn the Children of Isotope against Neuron, or even Tyrant. I need you to find this Prophet, but it won't be easy."
// SendOffString :
"P3319196349" "We've already sent a few teams down to see what they could find, only some of them have returned. The highest activity from the Children appear to be in sub-sector 813. Go down there, see what you can find out about the Prophet, and keep an eye out for search teams, if they any were captured then you might be able to save them before they are judged on the radiant altars."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2891189300" "Search for the Prophet"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."

