// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StealthSuitClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2797892560" "Stealth Suit"
// DetailString :
"P357381543" "While activated you are almost completely undetectable. Be careful not to get too close to anyone or they may notice something amiss."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - VirusClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3873850235" "Heatwave ICE Melter"
// DetailString :
"P3879583279" "Aaron Walker has developed this computer virus to target and destroy Black ICE. Once the virus is in the system it will enable Aaron to slip in, modify the computer files, and then slip out. After a couple minutes the virus deletes itself and all traces, to prevent Neuron's scientists from analyzing it to guard against it. All you need to do is make sure it gets uploaded into the computer systems, Aaron will take care of the rest of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - VirusUploadedClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P399149945" "Virus Uploaded"
// DetailString :
"P3680708829" "You installed the Heatwave ICE Melter virus into the labs systems. Within seconds Aaron Walker was in the system causing havoc."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResequencerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P510600786" "Genetic Resequencer Evidence"
// DetailString :
"P2325118235" "You took some hard evidence of Neuron's morally bankrupt experimentation. These genetic resequencer files show about a dozen different combinations Neuron has already produced, with hundreds more lined up for future projects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MitosisClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1418288574" "Accelerated Mitosis Evidence"
// DetailString :
"P3833732028" "Neuron's not only experimenting on people, but cloning the results and hastening along the development with these Mitosis Accelerator machines. These samples are evidence enough to prove that what Neuron is doing is inhuman."

